Well, there are a few items that can be pretty useful when cursed.

One is a scroll of teleport, which becomes level teleport when cursed (but
make sure you have teleport control before you use this item!).

If I can manage to get a good weapon, I personally like a cursed scroll of
create monsters, which will fill a large room full of random monsters
(dangerous but fun).    ;^)

Another one is genocide.  Use a cursed genocide scroll to summon a room full
of nurses (make certain you are buck naked and unarmed, and there are no
nasties around).  The nurses will surround you and beat you healthy.   ;^)

A cursed scroll of taming will let you kill that peaceful monster that is
bothering you, without taking a luck penalty (makes all monsters within one
square "unpeaceful").

A cursed scroll of gain level will raise you up to the dungeon level above you
(ie if you are on level 10, this scroll will take you to level 9).  This could
come in handy if a powerful wizard were chasing you from level to level, and
you seemed to be unable to teleport to escape him, for some reason.

Well, that is all the uses for cursed items that I can think of.  Does anyone
know of any others?

